{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790620/extras/a3f3b1f725589744e07c6f428197e7ae.avif?t=1758041109\" width=707 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>\u201cAwareness is the first step to escape.\u201d</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Soft(A)ware</i> is a surreal puzzle-platformer set inside a vast, hostile system. You awaken in a virtual world that functions as a prison \u2014 a place designed to limit, to control, to erase any trace of freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you are not helpless. By disrupting the rules of this world, you can bend gravity, rewind time, and outwit the constructs hunting you. Each challenge is both a puzzle to solve and a test of how far you\u2019re willing to push against the system that holds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity-shifting traversal</strong> \u2014 walk on walls, ceilings, and impossible paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time-rewind mechanics</strong> \u2014 undo mistakes, experiment freely, and master temporal puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modular level design</strong> \u2014 hand-crafted challenges mixed with procedural variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets and hidden pathways</strong> \u2014 rewards for exploration beyond the obvious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A surreal digital atmosphere</strong> \u2014 discover a world of shifting constructs and quiet oppression.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action leaves a mark. Every choice destabilizes control. And every step brings you closer to understanding what \u2014 and who \u2014 is truly trapped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The following modes are available (once unlocked):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story Plus (once the story has been completed once)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless (once tutorials are completed)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story, learn the mechanics (and how to break them).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities and new obstacles are slowly introduced as the game progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Plus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocked by finishing the story once, replay the story with all abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Higher difficulty levels are available and certain events are already in effect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows, perhaps you could even discover a new ending?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Endless</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play endless generated levels until you fail, climb the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more levels completed and the faster you complete a level, the higher your score.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no saving, there is no resetting to checkpoint. There are no checkpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep going for as long as you can with infinite procedural level possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1790620/extras/a88afe7370e2d9bcba7f92d6c5467037.poster.avif?t=175804110